    "text": "live5news.com\nwebsite\nSt George\nJob training center in St. George to close as online enrollment soars\nBy Nick Reagan,\n1 days agoST. GEORGE, S.C. (WCSC) - Trident Technical College is shutting down its QuickJobs Training Center in St. George at the end of the month. College officials say the center doesn’t get nearly as much use as it used to when it was opened in 2010, but not for the reasons you might think.\n1",
